	)
	(text "MOTOR POWER (12V, 14-16 AWG, never on breadboard)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 73.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c296e8a3-57bf-5967-b743-154b51268565")
	)
	(text "WIRING RULES (firmware/CIRCUIT.md)\n- Mains L/N/Earth into the 12V 15A SMPS is not shown. Earth the SMPS case; switch on Live.\n- +12V, ESC V+/V- and motor phases: thick wire, XT60/bullets, never through the breadboard.\n- Star ground near buck VOUT-: SMPS -, buck -, ESC signal GND, ESP32 GND, OLED, tach, E-stop.\n- Set the buck to 5.0V before connecting the ESP32. ESC BEC 5V stays unconnected.\n- USB rule: never USB and buck 5V on ESP32 VIN at the same time.\n- OLED on 5V: check the module's SDA/SCL pull-ups go to 3.3V (ESP32 pins are not 5V tolerant)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 210.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d5557307-9c01-525f-9b23-036f42cd9e61")
	)
	(text "C1: solder right at\nthe ESC V+/V- input"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 63.5 43.18 0)
		(effects
